{"ref":"BDB Aramaic, הוּא","hw":"הוּא","html":"† <big><big><span dir=\"rtl\">הוּא</span></big></big><sub>14</sub><big></big>  <strong>m.</strong> <span dir=\"rtl\">הִיא</span> <sub>7</sub> <strong>f. pron. of 3 s. he, she, it (</strong>= BH <span dir=\"rtl\">הוּא</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">הִיא</span>; Zinj. and Palm. (once) <span dir=\"rtl\">הא</span>, Palm. (usually) Nab. Egyptian Aramaic <span dir=\"rtl\">הו</span>, f. <span dir=\"rtl\">הי</span>, Lzb<sup>257</sup>, S-C<sup>Pap. A 1, 12 +; A 4, C 9 +</sup>. The pl. is <span dir=\"rtl\">אִנּוּן</span>, q.v.<strong>)</strong>;—<em>he, she, it</em>, <a data-ref=\"Daniel 2:21\" href=\"/Daniel.2.21\">Dn 2:21</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">וְהוּא מְהַשְׁנֵא</span> … and <em>he</em> will change, etc., v <a data-ref=\"Daniel 2:22\" href=\"/Daniel.2.22\">22</a>, <a data-ref=\"Daniel 2:44\" href=\"/Daniel.2.44\">44</a>; <a data-ref=\"Daniel 6:5\" href=\"/Daniel.6.5\">6:5</a>; <a data-ref=\"Daniel 7:7\" href=\"/Daniel.7.7\">7:7</a>, <a data-ref=\"Daniel 7:24\" href=\"/Daniel.7.24\">24</a> <a data-ref=\"Ezra 5:8\" href=\"/Ezra.5.8\">Ezr 5:8</a>; <a data-ref=\"Daniel 2:32\" href=\"/Daniel.2.32\">Dn 2:32</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">הוּא צַלְמָא</span> <em>that</em> image (nom. pend.); <a data-ref=\"Daniel 4:19\" href=\"/Daniel.4.19\">4:19</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">אַנְתָּה הוּא</span> thou art <em>it</em>. Resuming the subj. with emph. (BH <strong>2 b</strong>) <a data-ref=\"Daniel 2:47\" href=\"/Daniel.2.47\">2:47</a>; <a data-ref=\"Daniel 6:17\" href=\"/Daniel.6.17\">6:17</a>; resuming the subj. in predication (<em>ib.</em> <strong>3 b</strong>) <a data-ref=\"Daniel 2:20\" href=\"/Daniel.2.20\">2:20</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">חָכְמְתָא וּגְבוּרְתָּא דִּי־לֵהּ הִיא</span> <em>it</em> is his, v <a data-ref=\"Daniel 2:28\" href=\"/Daniel.2.28\">28</a>. Anticipating the subj. (<em>ib.</em> <strong>4 a</strong>) <a data-ref=\"Daniel 2:9\" href=\"/Daniel.2.9\">2:9</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">הֲדָא הִיא דָֽתְכוֹן</span>; with a pron. (<em>ib.</em> <strong>4 b</strong>) <a data-ref=\"Daniel 2:38\" href=\"/Daniel.2.38\">2:38</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">אַנְתְּה הוּא</span> … <em>thou art</em> the head of gold <a data-ref=\"Daniel 5:13\" href=\"/Daniel.5.13\">5:13</a>; <a data-ref=\"Daniel 3:15\" href=\"/Daniel.3.15\">3:15</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">מַן הוּא אֱלָהּ</span> … <em>who is</em> the good …? (so pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">אִנּוּן</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezra 5:4\" href=\"/Ezra.5.4\">Ezr 5:4</a>); <a data-ref=\"Daniel 4:27\" href=\"/Daniel.4.27\">4:27</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">הֲלָא דָא הִיא</span> … (<em>ib.</em> <strong>4 b</strong> γ); <a data-ref=\"Daniel 6:27\" href=\"/Daniel.6.27\">6:27</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">דִּי הוּא</span> … <em>who is</em> … (<em>ib.</em> <strong>2 c</strong>), <a data-ref=\"Ezra 6:15\" href=\"/Ezra.6.15\">Ezr 6:15</a> (so <span dir=\"rtl\">דִּי אִנּוּן</span> … <a data-ref=\"Daniel 7:17\" href=\"/Daniel.7.17\">Dn 7:17</a>). [cf. in 𝔗 <a data-ref=\"Exodus 14:25\" href=\"/Exodus.14.25\">Ex 14:25</a>; <a data-ref=\"Exodus 15:11\" href=\"/Exodus.15.11\">15:11</a> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 20:19\" href=\"/II_Samuel.20.19\">2 S 20:19</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 24:17\" href=\"/II_Samuel.24.17\">24:17</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 43:2\" href=\"/Psalms.43.2\">ψ 43:2</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 63:4\" href=\"/Psalms.63.4\">63:4</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 66:3\" href=\"/Psalms.66.3\">66:3</a> +.] Affirming existence (BH <strong>6 b</strong>) <a data-ref=\"Daniel 4:21\" href=\"/Daniel.4.21\">Dn 4:21</a>. cf. K<sup>§ 87, 3</sup>. <span dir=\"rtl\">הוּבַד</span> v. [<a data-ref=\"BDB Aramaic, אֲבַד\" href=\"/BDB Aramaic,_אֲבַד\", dir=\"rtl\">אֲבַד</a>].","next":"BDB Aramaic, הֵיכַל","prev":"BDB Aramaic, הֲוָא"}